<p style="text-align: center"><a href="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260521/2e778660-443e-4be2-92c8-4c443239e88c.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="全球首发天玑9500 Monster！iQOO 15T图赏" h="399" src="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260521/S2e778660-443e-4be2-92c8-4c443239e88c.jpg" style="border:black 1px solid" w="600" /></a></p>
