<p style="text-align: center"><a href="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260521/13b04063-bd84-40a3-b81e-d51f9f67c1a1.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="全球首发天玑9500 Monster！iQOO 15T图赏" h="400" src="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260521/S13b04063-bd84-40a3-b81e-d51f9f67c1a1.jpg" style="border:black 1px solid" w="600" /></a></p>
