<p style="text-align: center"><a href="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260521/8632b1c1-5e75-4fcb-a9c8-2bf2939bdfc0.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="全球首发天玑9500 Monster！iQOO 15T图赏" h="400" src="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260521/S8632b1c1-5e75-4fcb-a9c8-2bf2939bdfc0.jpg" style="border:black 1px solid" w="600" /></a></p>
<p style="text-align: center"><a href="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260521/67e38b08-0caf-4540-bbaa-d9bf609ebc90.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="全球首发天玑9500 Monster！iQOO 15T图赏" h="400" src="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260521/S67e38b08-0caf-4540-bbaa-d9bf609ebc90.jpg" style="border:black 1px solid" w="600" /></a></p>
