<p align="center"><a href="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260521/b8b6ef0b08f245a4b9c24b53645997cc.png" target="_blank"><img alt="目前仅RTX 4060一半水平！3299元的砺算科技7G100国产显卡性能一览：你觉得如何" h="335" src="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260521/s_b8b6ef0b08f245a4b9c24b53645997cc.png" style="border: black 1px solid;" w="600" /></a></p>
